### 󠀁[Props](https://developer.wordpress.org/block-editor/reference-guides/components/progress-bar/?output_format=md#props)󠁿

The component accepts the following props:

#### 󠀁[value: number](https://developer.wordpress.org/block-editor/reference-guides/components/progress-bar/?output_format=md#value-number)󠁿

The progress value, a number from 0 to 100.
 If a `value` is not specified, the 
progress bar will be considered indeterminate.

 * Required: No
